  "description": "Schematic anatomical eye cross-section preserving the historical labels 1..10, anterior/posterior ordering, pupil opening, vitreous chamber, retinal lining, and optic-nerve exit. This is not a complete modern anatomical diagram or a thin-lens ray construction.",
