      {
        "id": "src184-globe",
        "description": "One anterior-left eye cross-section with outer scleral boundary and inner posterior retinal lining; 1 targets outer lower-left wall, 9 inner upper-right lining, 10 the exiting posterior optic-nerve bundle. Smooth outlines are schematic regularization, not source dimensions.",
        "objects": ["sclera-outer", "sclera-inner", "retina", "optic-nerve", "sclera-target", "retina-target", "nerve-target", "callout-1", "callout-9", "callout-10", "number-1", "number-9", "number-10"],
